---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="CarryCtx - AI Agent Project Continuity">
	<main>
		<section class="hero">
			<h1>Give your AI agents <span class="highlight">persistent memory</span></h1>
			<p class="subtitle">
				CarryCtx is a SQLite-backed context and continuity manager for coding agents. Track task progress, create state checkpoints, and seamlessly resume work across sessions and git worktrees.
			</p>
			<div class="actions">
				<a href="https://github.com/Xuepoo/carryctx" class="btn">Get Started</a>
				<div class="code-copy">
					<code>cargo install carryctx</code>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section id="features" class="features-grid">
			<div class="feature-card">
				<h3>🔄 Session Continuity</h3>
				<p>Agents can register identities, start sessions, and resume exactly where they left off without losing context in their memory window.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="feature-card">
				<h3>📋 Task Management</h3>
				<p>Create, claim, and block tasks. Keep track of what's done, what's remaining, and any identified risks.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="feature-card">
				<h3>💾 State Checkpointing</h3>
				<p>Capture rich semantic snapshots of project state, git status, and remaining work before ending sessions or handing off to another agent.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="feature-card">
				<h3>🌿 Worktree Parallelism</h3>
				<p>Spin up isolated Git worktrees linked to specific tasks, allowing multiple agents to work concurrently without stepping on each other's toes.</p>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>

<style>
	.hero {
		padding: 5rem 0;
		text-align: center;
		max-width: 800px;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.hero h1 {
		font-size: 3.5rem;
		line-height: 1.2;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		color: #1a1a1a;
	}

	.highlight {
		color: var(--accent);
		font-style: italic;
	}

	.subtitle {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		margin-bottom: 3rem;
		font-family: var(--font-serif);
	}

	.actions {
		display: flex;
		gap: 1.5rem;
		justify-content: center;
		align-items: center;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
	}

	.code-copy {
		background: var(--code-bg);
		padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
		border-radius: 6px;
		border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		color: var(--text-main);
	}

	.code-copy code {
		background: transparent;
		padding: 0;
		color: inherit;
	}

	.features-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
		gap: 2rem;
		margin-top: 4rem;
	}

	.feature-card {
		background: var(--card-bg);
		padding: 2.5rem;
		border-radius: 12px;
		border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
		box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.02), 0 2px 4px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.02);
		transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
	}

	.feature-card:hover {
		transform: translateY(-2px);
		box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03), 0 4px 6px -2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.02);
	}

	.feature-card h3 {
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		color: var(--text-main);
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.5rem;
	}

	.feature-card p {
		color: var(--text-muted);
		font-size: 0.95rem;
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.hero h1 {
			font-size: 2.5rem;
		}
		
		.actions {
			flex-direction: column;
		}
	}
</style>
